    "tagLine": "Bespoke Design in every Apartment",
    "location": "Located beside the Grand Canal and only a 20-minute walk from the city centre, Harold’s Cross is a lively and bustling suburb with an excellent public transport service.  The local neighbourhoods of Harolds Cross and Rathmines are modern, diverse and steeped in history, and home to an exciting mix of restaurants, pubs and things-to-do.  There is a particularly strong sense of community in the area, Harold’s Cross is well known and well loved, with an exciting entertainment scene and a wide range of local amenities - including a handful of spots serving up delicious coffee and fresh pastries every day.  An excellent choice of sports & leisure facilities nearby. Branching out a little further, locals can avail of the delights on offer in neighbouring Rathgar and Ranelagh, both within short walking distance."
