  "description": "The 2 Bedroom Apartments in Mill Pond are expertly laid out. The development features a landscaped garden on the grounds with mature planting and seating area for residents’ recreation. Each individual apartment at Mill Pond has been treated with its own unique interior design solution - tones and furnishings, carefully selected to create a more central, homely flow. \n\nThese stunning 2 bedroom apartments leave a lasting impression. The entrance hallway is warm and welcoming, with a stylish mirror and table set as the central point of focus.  Here, the visitor gets a sense of the home, drawn in further by the lighting and subtle tones in the interiors.\n\nThe kitchen is sleek and beautifully finished, fully-equipped with top of the range, integrated appliances.  Streamlined cabinets and work spaces are the true mark of modern kitchen design, allowing for an openness and flow between the kitchen and dining area.  The dining area itself features restaurant-style seating and is its own intimate setting - perfect for a memorable dining experience.\n\nThe main living area opens out now to vintage-style furniture and seating arranged around a large rug - the focal point of the room.  The couch is luscious and inviting and there are two single-seaters whose style deviates from the overall theme of the home, completing a unique design solution for the space they inhabit.  There is a dedicated work space in the corner and floor-to-ceiling sliding doors lead out on to a generously sized balcony.\n\nThe bedrooms are spacious and airy, featuring warm carpeting and floor-to-ceiling curtains.  The colour palette here will inspire relaxation and solitude for these are havens of comfort and rest.  The beds are large and comfortable - the perfect refuge after a long day and when all you want to do is recharge!\nThe bathrooms are modern in design, finished with ‘subway station’ tiling.  The main bathroom is spacious and features a bath/power-shower while the en-suite features a power-shower and in both, a large shower screen encloses the wet area.\n\nCar parking if required is available at an additional cost. \n\nMill Pond is a stunning new apartment development beside Harold's Cross, a much sought-after address on Dublin's south side, bordering the districts of Dublin 6, 6W and Dublin 12.  Mill Pond is located off Parnell Avenue, adjacent to the Grand Canal and nestled in its own quiet enclave.  Its proximity to local amenities, the city centre and the greater South Dublin area will put residents at the centre of a modern and exciting urban living experience.  The development features a landscaped garden on the grounds with mature planting and seating area for residents' recreation.\n\n\nLocated beside the Grand Canal and only a 20-minute walk from the city centre, Harold’s Cross is a lively and bustling suburb with an excellent public transport service.  The local neighbourhoods of Harolds Cross and Rathmines are modern, diverse and steeped in history, and home to an exciting mix of restaurants, pubs and things-to-do.  There is a particularly strong sense of community in the area, Harold’s Cross is well known and well loved, with an exciting entertainment scene and a wide range of local amenities - including a handful of spots serving up delicious coffee and fresh pastries every day.  An excellent choice of sports & leisure facilities nearby. Branching out a little further, locals can avail of the delights on offer in neighbouring Rathgar and Ranelagh, both within short walking distance. \n\n*Photos and VR Tours represent a mixture of the standard of finishes available throughout the development. \n\n**Please note: \n1) There are multiple property types available in this development. The photos shown here may not be of the actual unit available but represent the standard of finish. \n\n2) The rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types. Rents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type. Not all the available properties and rents are listed here; please use those available at viewings. \n\n3) The overall BER Rating on this development is A Rated, an individual BER cert for your specific apartment is available on move in, upon request.",
